    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "Implemented in source and integrated into the combined dispatcher/config/editor. The guard resolves each configured item's live ITEM_DATABASE core effects, greys/disables the item through Rockstar's inventory availability layer only when `current core < cost` (equality remains usable), blocks the cached quick-use action, and cancels a normal/context item-interaction bypass before its authored consume/effect event. It currently covers all 15 negative-core consumables in `MyOverhaul/catalog_sp.ymt`, including multi-core costs. `[CoreCostGuard] Enabled=1` hot-reloads within about two seconds. Static verifier passes; this remains `actionable` until the exact combined ASI is built, installed, and hash-verified.",
